/// @defgroup core core
/// Value types, pure functions and the facades every other module builds on: the frame contract,
/// timing, the handover between threads, logging and profiling. Links no SDL.
///
/// @par Routing
/// Routes between any two tiles over sectors, whole numbers with fixed tie-breaks (the game uses only `core/paths.hpp` so far):
/// - `core/route_graph.hpp`: the map cut into sectors, each sector's graph of gates and places per profile
///   (`BuildSector`, `SectorWalk`), and the graph of the whole map (`RouteGraph`, `RouteGraphs`, `ROUTING_VERSION`).
/// - `core/route_search.hpp`: `FindGraphRoute`, an A* over a graph with the route's ends joined to their blocks, and the
///   `RouteScratch` workspace.
/// - `core/place_table.hpp`: `PlaceTable`, each city's cost to every place in reach, and `ReachBound`.
/// - `core/segments.hpp`: `SegmentStore`, the tiles, costs and walk marks of the edges routes use, made once.
/// - `core/paths.hpp`: the distance maps and `FindRoute`, the cheapest route the graph's routes are compared with.
